# 7. Decision Matrix

| Requirement | Recommended Solution |
|-------------|----------------------|
| Lowest Budget | AI Camera + PTZ |
| Medium Budget | Thermal + PTZ |
| Long Range | Radar + PTZ |
| Very Low False Alarm | LiDAR + PTZ |
| Night Surveillance | Thermal + PTZ |
| Heavy Fog | Radar |
| Wildlife Area | Thermal + AI |
| Coastal Area | Marine Radar + Thermal |
| Solar Farm | Thermal + PTZ |
| Data Center | Fiber Fence + LiDAR + PTZ |
| Oil & Gas | Thermal + Radar + PTZ |
| Power Plant | Radar + Thermal + PTZ |
| Airport | Radar + Thermal + PTZ |
| Military | Radar + LiDAR + Thermal + PTZ + Counter-UAS |
| National Border | Multi-layer Sensor Fusion |

