# 8. Industry-Specific Recommended Architectures

## Airport

- Radar + PTZ + Thermal
- Radar + PTZ + Thermal + Drone Detection
- LiDAR + Radar + PTZ (high-value restricted zones)

---

## Military Base

- Radar + LiDAR + Thermal + PTZ + Counter-UAS
- Fiber Fence + Radar + Thermal + PSIM
- Seismic Sensors + Thermal + PTZ (covert approach detection)

---

## Border Security

- Ground Surveillance Radar + EO/IR + Thermal
- Radar + LiDAR + Counter-UAS
- Seismic + Acoustic + Thermal + PTZ
- Aerostat/UAV + Radar + PSIM (very long-range sectors)

---

## Data Center

- Fiber Fence + LiDAR + PTZ
- Thermal + Access Control + VMS
- Radar + PTZ (large campuses)

---

## Oil & Gas / Refinery

- Thermal + Radar + PTZ
- Gas Detection + Thermal + SCADA
- Fiber Fence + Radar + Thermal

---

## Port / Coastal Facility

- Marine Radar + Thermal + PTZ
- AIS + Radar + VMS
- Waterside Sonar (where required) + Thermal + PTZ

---

## Power Plant / Nuclear

- Fiber Fence + Radar + Thermal + PTZ
- LiDAR + Thermal (critical inner zones)
- PSIM + GIS + Multi-sensor Fusion

---

## Solar Farm

- Thermal + PTZ
- Thermal + Radar (large sites)
- AI Cameras + Thermal (budget deployments)

